oup and 365 Data Centers as a prospective long-term tenant, so the IM3 canonical name is retained as a legacy label rather than evidence that Digital Realty remains the operator.","record_status":"active","review_decision_id":"rvw_im3_db35e8549e5790dfe2a5","review_type":"classification","reviewer":{"identifier":"dccio-bootstrap-review","type":"human"},"schema_version":"1.0.0","subject_refs":[{"entity_id":"lnp_im3_94bf626e7d3e66ab0db9","entity_type":"lifecycle_national_priority_record"},{"entity_id":"fac_im3_building_00122665255","entity_type":"facility"}],"updated_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z"},{"created_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z","decided_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z","decision":"accept","evidence_claim_ids":["clm_im3_855a4125dcb7a0bb286d","clm_im3_c1c1b043eada35892eec"],"rationale":"Digital Realty's current CH1 page identifies the exact 2200 Busse Road facility and offers active data-center space, support, compliance, and 24x7 security. The page's 485,000-square-foot value is explicitly total building size and is accepted as a facility observation.","record_status":"active","review_decision_id":"rvw_im3_1535af03459ed6f3785d","review_type":"classification","reviewer":{"identifier":"dccio-bootstrap-review","type":"human"},"schema_version":"1.0.0","subject_refs":[{"entity_id":"lnp_im3_209a9d00de63856e166a","entity_type":"lifecycle_national_priority_record"},{"entity_id":"fac_im3_building_00128499684","entity_type":"facility"}],"updated_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z"},{"created_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z","decided_at":"2026-09-01T23:00:00Z","decision":"accept","evidence_claim_ids":["clm_im3_eb1b2bf6040128b48e48"],"rationale":"Loudoun County issued a 2024 alteration permit for rack installations at the exact 45360 West Severn Way data-center building and explicitly labels the work IAD 10. Exact-code, address, and data-center structure matches support current operation; no third-party capacity or area is accepted.","record_status":"active","review_decision_id":"rvw_im3_a275cb25fe1